# Heartless Act, first mode: "Destroy target creature with no counters on it." Abigale gives Bot2's Ornithopter three counters, so it is
# not a legal target (the refusal), while Bot1's own Ornithopter, with none, is (the positive control) and is destroyed. Bot2's
# Ornithopter keeps its counters.

